f <strong>[Op \u2013 the older twin]</strong><br>\u201cOp\u201d is a cool-headed INTP who enjoys card games and specializes in ranged attacks.<br>Use talisman cards with various effects by placing them onto the battlefield!<br>Drag cards directly onto enemies or set down lasting effect cards for strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when apart, Co and Op can support each other by building <strong>Co-Op Stacks</strong> and sharing bonuses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co</strong> assists with powerful rhythm combo skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Op</strong> sends helpful cards over to Co\u2019s screen for support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they build Co-Op Stacks to unlock shared bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, various co-op skills and hidden mechanics await, letting the twins grow stronger through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Fusion Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During their dungeon journey, the twins suddenly reunite\u2014only to be fused into a single body by a glitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, both players control one fused character:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Co</strong> handles movement, dodging, and melee attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Op</strong> manages cards and ranged attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b A special <strong>Hardcore \u201cFusion Mode\u201d</strong> is also available for solo players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Cardboard Dungeon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through endless cardboard box dungeons, battling ferocious monsters and chapter bosses together!<br>Even in defeat, loot and resources you\u2019ve collected remain, fueling permanent upgrades for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Shifting Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world where reality and the game blend together, the twins receive guidance from a mysterious cat NPC, <strong>\u201cSchr\u00f6dinger.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each cycle of death and rebirth, your choices shape the dungeon: NPC dialogue, branching paths, and story direction gradually evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883280/extras/43d0be27dce1fd644cc7f7cef1ed0d25.avif?t=1759157321\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883280/extras_big/43d0be27dce1fd644cc7f7cef1ed0d25.webp?t=1759157321 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p>","developers":["TWO PLAYER"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883280/9c33cb16b3f5f30ed50cae161001caccbf80cfb4/header.jpg?t=1759157321","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883280/19522708/be8007067d0872803c9d405c04ad6993764d4190/1755762158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755763218","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883280/19522708/be8007067d0872803c9d405c04ad6993764d4190/1755762158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755763218","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883280/19522708/be8007067d0872803c9d405c04ad6993764d4190/1755762158/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755763218","id":257186506,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186506/movie480.mp4?t=1755763218","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186506/movie_max